.TH WERKMEISTER-FEATURE-STOP 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-feature\-stop \- Stop containers without removing them or releasing the slot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister feature stop\fR [feature]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Stops a feature's containers without removing them or releasing its slot. A start of the feature still waiting for capacity leaves the queue too. Bring it back with \fBwerkmeister feature restart\fR or \fBwerkmeister feature up\fR. Use \fBinfra\fR as the feature name to stop the shared infrastructure.
.PP
Two commands do this without a person: \fBwerkmeister internal session\-end\fR is the SessionEnd hook behind a workspace's \fBauto_stop\fR, and \fBwerkmeister internal reap <minutes>\fR is one pass of the idle reaper over every workspace.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister feature stop my\-feature
werkmeister infra stop
werkmeister internal reap 30
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBwerkmeister feature down\fR also releases the slot; \fBwerkmeister feature pause\fR freezes the containers instead.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
